OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain, heavy at times in the
OL,6,Fsouthwest, spreads northeast across
OL,7,Fthe UK, with snow over Scottish
OL,8,Fmountains. Brighter conditions follow
OL,9,Ffrom the west later. Windy across
OL,10,FEngland, Wales and northern coasts.
OL,11,FMildest in the southwest, but colder
OL,12,Fin Scotland.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRain and mountain snow clear
OL,15,Feastwards, leaving scattered blustery
OL,16,Fshowers in the west, locally heavy
OL,17,Fwith a small chance of thunder near
OL,18,Fcoasts. Gales in the far northeast
OL,19,Fsoon ease.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
