OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloud and rain clear southeast
OL,6,FEngland, followed by sunshine and
OL,7,Fshowers, mostly in the north and west.
OL,8,FSome showers may be heavy with hail or
OL,9,Fthunder. Breezy with average
OL,10,Ftemperatures.
